@node File Menu Features
@subsection File Menu Features

@cindex File Menu Features

Anju makes the following modifications to the main menu bar @strong{File} menu:

@itemize
@item
Adds a “Swap Window ›” sub-menu.
@item
Updates the “New Frame on Display Server@dots{}” menu item to only display on an X11 system.
@item
Updates the “New Frame on Monitor…” menu item to only display if more than one monitor is detected.
@end itemize

For the macOS NS variant of Emacs, the above update to “New Frame on Monitor…” will only work on Emacs version 31+.

These modifications are optional. For more detail, see @ref{File Menu Customization}.

