* Edit Menu Customization::
* Options Menu Customization::
* Text Menu Customization::
* Bookmarks Menu Customization::
* Help Menu Customization::
* Imenu Menu Customization::
@end menu

@node File Menu Customization
@subsection File Menu Customization

@cindex File Menu Customization
@vindex anju-main-menu--reconfigure-file

The hook function @code{anju-main-menu--reconfigure-file} in @code{anju-reconfigure-main-menu-hook} modifies the @strong{File} menu in the main menu bar.

Enabling @code{anju-main-menu--reconfigure-file} can be done using the checkbox interface provided by @code{customize-variable} when modifying @code{anju-reconfigure-main-menu-hook}.

@code{anju-main-menu--reconfigure-file} supports the following customization variable:

@table @asis
@item @code{anju-file-menu-replace-make-frame-on}
If non-nil, the following menu items are replaced with more context-specific behavior:

@itemize
@item
“New Frame on Display Server@dots{}” - will only display if on an X11 system.
@item
“New Frame on Monitor@dots{}” - will only display if more than one monitor is detected.
@end itemize
@end table

@node Edit Menu Customization
@subsection Edit Menu Customization

@cindex Edit Menu Customization
@vindex anju-main-menu--reconfigure-edit

The hook function @code{anju-main-menu--reconfigure-edit} in @code{anju-reconfigure-main-menu-hook} modifies the @strong{Edit} menu in the main menu bar.

Enabling @code{anju-main-menu--reconfigure-edit} can be done using the checkbox interface provided by @code{customize-variable} when modifying @code{anju-reconfigure-main-menu-hook}.

@node Options Menu Customization
@subsection Options Menu Customization

@cindex Options Menu Customization
@vindex anju-main-menu--reconfigure-options

The hook function @code{anju-main-menu--reconfigure-options} in @code{anju-reconfigure-main-menu-hook} modifies the @strong{Options} menu in the main menu bar.

Enabling @code{anju-main-menu--reconfigure-options} can be done using the checkbox interface provided by @code{customize-variable} when modifying @code{anju-reconfigure-main-menu-hook}.

@node Text Menu Customization
@subsection Text Menu Customization

@cindex Text Menu Customization
@vindex anju-main-menu--reconfigure-text-mode

The hook function @code{anju-main-menu--reconfigure-text-mode} in @code{anju-reconfigure-main-menu-hook} modifies the @strong{Text} menu in the main menu bar.

Enabling @code{anju-main-menu--reconfigure-text-mode} can be done using the checkbox interface provided by @code{customize-variable} when modifying @code{anju-reconfigure-main-menu-hook}.

Note that the @strong{Text} menu is only displayed when the current major mode is derived from @code{text-mode}.

@node Bookmarks Menu Customization
@subsection Bookmarks Menu Customization

@cindex Bookmarks Menu Customization
@vindex anju-main-menu--reconfigure-bookmarks

The hook function @code{anju-main-menu--reconfigure-bookmarks} in @code{anju-reconfigure-main-menu-hook} adds the @strong{Bookmarks} menu to the main menu bar.

Enabling @code{anju-main-menu--reconfigure-bookmarks} can be done using the checkbox interface provided by @code{customize-variable} when modifying @code{anju-reconfigure-main-menu-hook}.

@node Help Menu Customization
@subsection Help Menu Customization

@cindex Help Menu Customization
@vindex anju-main-menu--reconfigure-help
@vindex anju-help-menu-remove-emacs-tutorial

The hook function @code{anju-main-menu--reconfigure-help} in @code{anju-reconfigure-main-menu-hook} modifies the @strong{Help} menu in the main menu bar.

Enabling @code{anju-main-menu--reconfigure-help} can be done using the checkbox interface provided by @code{customize-variable} in modifying @code{anju-reconfigure-main-menu-hook}.

@code{anju-main-menu--reconfigure-help} supports the following customization variable:

@table @asis
@item @code{anju-help-menu-remove-emacs-tutorial}
if non-nil, then remove the Emacs tutorial menu items. (default @code{t})
@end table

@node Imenu Menu Customization
@subsection Imenu Menu Customization

@cindex Imenu Menu Customization
@vindex anju-main-menu--reconfigure-imenu

The hook function @code{anju-main-menu--reconfigure-imenu} in @code{anju-reconfigure-main-menu-hook} adds the @strong{Index} menu to the main menu bar.

Enabling @code{anju-main-menu--reconfigure-file} can be done using the checkbox interface provided by @code{customize-variable} in modifying @code{anju-reconfigure-main-menu-hook}.

Anju's support for Imenu covers the following modes:

@itemize
@item
@code{prog-mode} derived modes
@item
@code{makefile-mode}
@item
@code{org-mode}
@item
@code{markdown-mode}
@end itemize

For more info on Imenu see @ref{Imenu,emacs#Imenu,,emacs,}.

@node Future Work
@chapter Future Work

@cindex Future Work

Work on Anju is on-going. Plans for future enhancements include:

@itemize
@item
Support for more built-in modes
@item
Further changes to the main menu
@end itemize

Although much consideration on both the user and developer experience has been made, they are both subject to change in future releases if a better approach presents itself.

